  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "創新服務與金融機構實務",
    "sub_ename": "INNOVATION SERVICE AND FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "因應金融科技的發展，金融機構已產生新的服務模式，基於金融機構的實務操作和決策分析，讓學生了解創新服務和金融機構之間的鏈結。本課程由金融機構和校內教師聯合授課，透過專題實作讓學生體會金融機構的最新發展。",
    "describe_eh": "With the development of financial technology, banks have produced new service models. Based on the practical operation and decision analysis of financial institutions, students can understand the linkage between innovative services and financial institutions. This course will be taught with senior managers from financial institutions. Through special topics in practice, students can experience the recent development of financial institutions.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能了解金融機構行為",
      "describe_en": "Understand the basic elements of financial institutions’ behaviors."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能分析不同的創新服務模式",
      "describe_en": "Analyze the different models of innovative services."
    }
